      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Blog · Setup (run once)\nCreates the master Google Sheet \"Nova Havens · Blog Automation\" with the five tabs, writes the header rows and seeds the Config tab.\n\n- Leave **Settings → existingSpreadsheetId** empty to create a new spreadsheet (headers + Config).\n- Put an ID there to refresh the **Config** tab of an existing spreadsheet (upsert by key; data tabs are left untouched).\n\nCopy the spreadsheet ID from **Resolve spreadsheet** into the Config node of the Daily Collector and Friday Synthesizer workflows.",
        "width": 1056,
        "height": 416
      }
    }
